This script creates masks for various individual seas and ocean 
around the world according to their official definition.

WARNING :
It has been developped on a ORCA1 grid and some boxes are hardcoded
with latitudes and longitudes that allow to follow the discretized 
coastline. Changing the grid, the coastline might be retreating in
the lands or advancing on the seas and it is necessary to check 
whether the output masks still follow the coastline wherever they 
are supposed to. 
